    placeholder\r\n\u2022 Adicionado VFXManager na cena de combate\r\n\u2022 Barra
    de Motivacao sumindo\r\n\u2022 Inimigo tanque importado\r\n\u2022 Modelos Placeholders
    importados\r\n\u2022 Diferenca visual entre inimigos base\r\n\u2022 Concepts
    Importados\r\n\u2022 Buzina Importado\r\n\u2022 VFX Placeholder Buff do Holofote\r\n\u2022
    Importados Sprites UI\r\n\u2022 Ajuste texto painel desafio\r\n\u2022 Fonte e
    Canvas atualizados\r\n\u2022 SFX Personagens & Inimigos\r\n\u2022 Preview de
    Efeitos\r\n\u2022 Interface Minigame\r\n\u2022 Controle de intensidade do fresnel
    (buff vfx)\r\n<b>Corre\xE7\xF5es</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Scene Name\r\n\u2022 Updated
    Unity Version\r\n\u2022 Gerar InputActions na pasta certa\r\n\u2022 A\xE7\xF5es
    derivadas OnCancel\r\n\u2022 Gerar Input Actions automaticamente\r\n\u2022 Cena
    de testes\r\n\u2022 Cursor n\xE3o detectava o target correto\r\n\u2022 input
    n\xE3o depender da ordem de inicializa\xE7\xE3o\r\n\u2022 Corre\xE7\xE3o da escala
    das tiles do palco\r\n\u2022 Cena inicial definida\r\n\u2022 Unity Editor impedindo
    build\r\n\u2022 Barra de Vida Interativa\r\n\u2022 Layer do Cursor Input\r\n\u2022
    Organizacao de Pastas UI\r\n\u2022 Removido Animator do Espectador\r\n\u2022
    Assets nao enviados\r\n\u2022 Animacoes Gerenciamento\r\n\u2022 Instancia de
    Input Global\r\n\u2022 Instancia Input Global 2\r\n\u2022 Cena de testes\r\n\u2022
    Erro de navegacao WorldMap\r\n\u2022 CursorInput n\xE3o atravessar UI\r\n\u2022
    Animacao de Combate Loopando\r\n\u2022 ajustes holofote e vfx de spawn\r\n\u2022
    Interface nao desligando na acao\r\n\u2022 Preview do Tile Out of Bound\r\n\u2022
    gameobject sem coalesce nulll\r\n\u2022 Desativacao de Painel\r\n\u2022 Efeito
    do Holofote ativando em movimento\r\n\u2022 mudancas nao enviadas\r\n\u2022 Curva
    de animacao leitura dialogo\r\n\u2022 Tiles se sobrepondo\r\n\u2022 Posicionamento
    Artes tela de Features\r\n\u2022 Remocao Collider Holofote\r\n\u2022 Troca de
    parametro AudioManager\r\n\u2022 Ajuste nas cores do vfx do Holofote\r\n\u2022
    Mudancas nao enviadas\r\n\u2022 Hover em linhas rotacionadas\r\n\u2022 Configuracao
    ataque Inimigo Tanque\r\n\u2022 Problemas de Build\r\n\u2022 loop da m\xFAsica\r\n\u2022
    Holofote\r\n\u2022 Soco Direcional\r\n\u2022 Cursor Input Singleton\r\n\u2022
    Pause Minigame\r\n\u2022 Loop da m\xFAsica (agr de vdd)\r\n\u2022 Scene Minigame\r\n\u2022
    Scene Template\r\n<b>Refatora\xE7\xF5es</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 sistema base de inputs
    completo\r\n\u2022 Target de efeitos\r\n\u2022 Organiza\xE7\xE3o dos scripts
    no projeto\r\n\u2022 ActionHandler > Inputhandler\r\n\u2022 Singleton sem heran\xE7a
    & renomes\r\n\u2022 Melhorias e ajustes nos scripts de combate (turnos)\r\n\u2022
    classes utilit\xE1rias\r\n\u2022 Organizacao Pastas e Scripts\r\n\u2022 Organizacao
    Pastas e Scripts Lucas\r\n\u2022 Simplifica\xE7\xE3o AudioManager\r\n\u2022 Organizacao
    Scriptable Objects de Combate\r\n\u2022 Utilities em scripts separados\r\n\u2022
    CursorInput ignore layer\r\n\u2022 Upgrade Scripts\r\n<b>Core</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022
    Ignorar arquivos VSCode\r\n\u2022 Troca de Direcao Barra de Motivacao\r\n\u2022
    Ignorar arquivos de crash local\r\n\u2022 Organizacao Pastas\r\n\u2022 Tela de
    Creditos\r\n\u2022 Colisor Barraca Gerenciamento\r\n<b>Outras Altera\xE7\xF5es</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022
    Created Project\r\n\u2022 Imported Packages\r\n\u2022 Add Private Scenes\r\n\u2022
    Add GitHub Actions workflow for building project\r\n\u2022 Add changelog generator
    workflow\r\n\u2022 Add 'development' branch to build workflow\r\n\u2022 Create
    Novo(a) Documento de Texto.txt\r\n\u2022 Revert \"Create Novo(a) Documento de
    Texto.txt\"\r\n\u2022 inicio input system\r\n\u2022 Adicionado o AudioManager
    com FMOD\r\n\u2022 Mudan\xE7as no AudioManager\r\n\u2022 Revert \"Style: Barraca
    de upgrades e canh\xE3o com UV aberto + Substitui\xE7\xE3o de assets com transform
    errado\"\r\n\u2022 Remo\xE7\xE3o dos Scripts\r\n\u2022 Refact: Script CameraManager\r\n\u2022
    Teste na Scene\r\n\u2022 Revert \"Teste na Scene\"\r\n\u2022 Corre\xE7\xF5es
    Scripts\r\n\u2022 Scene de Teste\r\n\u2022 Revert \"Merge branch 'lucas' into
    luiz\"\r\n\u2022 Reapply \"Merge branch 'lucas' into luiz\"\r\n\u2022 Update
    CameraManager.cs\r\n\u2022 Ajustes de Fade-Out\r\n\u2022 Update Ivan.unity\r\n\u2022
    Initial commit\r\n\u2022 Add initial test commit message to README\r\n"
